# Disaster Recovery Test Results

**Test Date:** December 15, 2025
**Scenario:** Full AWS region outage

## Test Objectives

- Validate our ability to fail over to the DR site
- Verify that the RTO of 4 hours can be achieved

## Results

- **Failover Time:** 3 hours 45 minutes ✓
- **Data Loss:** 0 (all data successfully replicated) ✓
- **Application Functionality:** All critical features operational ✓

## Lessons Learned

- The failover process worked as expected.
- Communication with customers during the test could be improved.

## Action Items

- Update the customer communication plan for DR scenarios
- Schedule next DR test for June 2026
